WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:04.671
None of us are the same people
we were 20 years ago.

00:00:05.088 --> 00:00:08.591
Being in successful
relationships takes work.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:12.345
None of us ever stop 
growing or evolving.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:16.599
Harpy, Hollywood 
has come a-calling.

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:19.686
They want to make “Unfinished Business”
into a movie.

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:21.146
Say what now?

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:22.439
Get your popcorn ready.

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.192
Woo!

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.203
That book caused 
a lot of drama.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.788
-You talk to Lance yet?
-I’m gonna.

00:00:38.788 --> 00:00:40.498
-Tell him now.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:42.792
Oy, ah!

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:43.793
What's up, Lance?

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:47.088
I would hug you, but not 
with that on the loose.

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:48.923
Oh, yeah, my bad.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.429
I'm glad that no one was around chronicling 
my college exploits.

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:55.764
Like when you 
were a stripper?

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:59.809
That was a very small part of Mommy’s undergraduate experience.

